  "slug": "an-instant-before-a-gaze",
  "name": { "en": "An Instant Before A Gaze", "zh-CN": "片刻，留在眼底" },
  "rarity": 5,
  "path": "Erudition",
  "announcedAt": "2026-11-16",
  "patchReleaseDate": null,
  "description": {
    "en": "He once heard a ballad, singing in praise of that sliver of light:\nRose blooms, to answer THEIR smile.\nDawn shines, to illuminate THEIR visage.\nMelody plays, to banish THEIR fatigue.\nBut, light, once gone, never returns. Yet, he still gallops to the far beyond.\nAll that is needed is to wait for, to believe in, and to preach about everything that is of the Beauty in this cosmos.\nEven if everything is but a fleeting instant before a gaze, he has already found the answer he sought.",
    "zh-CN": "他曾听闻歌谣，传唱那道光芒：\n玫瑰盛放，定是为了回应祂的笑容；\n晨光烁耀，定是为了照亮祂的脸庞；\n音律奏鸣，定是为了唤醒祂的倦眸。\n但那光芒一去不复返，他仍奔向远方\n——只须等待，只须信仰，只须将纯美的一切播撒于寰宇。\n即使一切都只是留在眼底的片刻，他却已收获想要的答案。"
  },
  "skill": {
    "name": { "en": "A Knight's Pilgrimage", "zh-CN": "骑士巡礼" },
    "description": {
      "en": "Increases the wearer's CRIT DMG by #1[i]%. When the wearer uses Ultimate, increases DMG dealt by the wearer's Ultimate based on their Max Energy. Each point of Energy increases DMG dealt by Ultimate by #2[f2]%. A max of #3[i] points of Energy will be taken into account for this.",
      "zh-CN": "使装备者的暴击伤害提高#1[i]%。当装备者施放终结技时，根据装备者的能量上限，提高装备者终结技造成的伤害：每点能量提高#2[f2]%，最多计入#3[i]点。"
    },
